{"skill":{"slug":"apollo-api","displayName":"Apollo"},"version":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790935898774,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":51303,"sha256":"5a02e19ee5795b86a7cab1dd9f38ffa4ad84615720397422e5b1167676b6813d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2038,"sha256":"3eb2f4ca9acef26ee194ae53e04d35e51774c1cec4370bb5afeefcb2146f57a0","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790936453790,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"061956035965ee00d9e0d01793d5beefe389d9f81eb720133c5ebb38723ff65b","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/061956035965ee00d9e0d01793d5beefe389d9f81eb720133c5ebb38723ff65b","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790936217804},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790936453790},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a disclosed Apollo.io integration that gives strong cautions around credentials, writes, enrichment data, and automation setup.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill uses network access, OAuth credentials, and optional API-key fallback, which are proportionate for an API integration but involve business and personal data held in Apollo.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill instructs users to install a pinned Maton CLI via npm or Homebrew and mentions optional SDK packages; this is disclosed and coherent with the integration, but users should verify they want Maton installed and authenticated.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Runtime instructions are scoped to user-approved Apollo and Maton operations, default to read/list actions, require confirmation for writes and new connections, and treat external API data as untrusted.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens are stored in the OS credential store and Maton functions/triggers can create persistent automation, but the artifact repeatedly requires explicit approval, narrow scoping, private functions, DENY_ALL network policy by default, and destination disclosure.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The documented capabilities match the stated purpose: Apollo API access through Maton for prospecting, enrichment, contacts, accounts, sequences, and email-message search, with write operations called out as requiring confirmation.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to connect Apollo through Maton. Review OAuth scopes, prefer read-only access where possible, confirm every write or sequence action before it runs, and be especially careful with enrichment or trigger destinations because they can expose personal or business data.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790936453790}}}}}